 JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md`.

+## Authentication and roles
+
+Send `Authorization: Bearer <key>` on every request. Keys are configured in
+`apiKeys` in the data file. The seed contains example keys `viewer-key`,
+`cook-key` and `manager-key`; replace them before use. Migrated files have no
+keys until configured. Missing or unknown keys return `unauthorized` (401),
+and insufficient permissions return `forbidden` (403).
+
+Viewers may use GET routes except `/audit`. Cooks may also cook recipes,
+record waste, log temperatures and enter stock-take counts. Managers may use
+all routes. Successful data-changing requests are recorded with time, key name,
+method, path and response status. `GET /audit` returns entries newest first
+and is restricted to managers.
+
+## Routes
+
+- `GET /items`, `GET /items/:id`, `GET /items/:id/best-price`, `PUT /items/:id/allergens`
+- `GET /batches`, `GET /batches/:id`, `POST /batches/:id/waste`
+- `POST /orders`, `GET /orders/:id`, `POST /orders/:id/send`, `POST /orders/:id/receive`, `POST /orders/:id/cancel`
+- `POST /recipes/:id/cook`, `GET /recipes/:id/cost`, `GET /recipes/:id/allergens`
+- `GET /reports/stock-value`, `GET /reports/waste`, `GET /reports/margins`, `GET /reports/allergens`, `GET /reports/temperatures`
+- `GET /alerts`, `GET /suppliers`, `GET /suppliers/:id/prices`, `POST /prices`
+- `GET /dishes`, `POST /dishes`, `GET /forecast/use/:itemId`, `GET /forecast/reorder`
+- `GET /outbox`, `POST /outbox/:id/sent`, `POST /import/items`, `POST /jobs/nightly`
+- `POST /stocktakes`, `POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`, `POST /stocktakes/:id/finish`
+- `POST /temperatures`, `GET /export/ledger.csv`, `GET /export/stock.csv`, `GET /audit`
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
